  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have mastered the art of creating fearsome ambushes, granting you the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ambusher's Leap.</strong> At the start of your first turn of each combat, your Speed increases by 10 feet until the end of that turn.</p><p><strong>Dreadful Strike.</strong> When you attack a creature and hit it with a weapon, you can deal an extra 2d6 Psychic damage. You can use this benefit only once per turn, a number of times equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><p><strong>Initiative Bonus.</strong> When you roll Initiative, you can add your Wisdom modifier to the roll.</p>",
